          "urgency": "Expected",
          "description": "* WHAT...Increased risk of sneaker waves and strong rip currents\ndue to incoming long period southerly swell associated with\ntropical activity in the Eastern Pacific Ocean. Breaking waves\nto around 10 feet expected.\n\n* WHERE...Pacific Coast beaches.\n\n* WHEN...Through Monday evening.\n\n* IMPACTS...Dangerous conditions are forecast along the\nshoreline. Hazards include sneaker waves, strong rip currents,\nand large breaking waves.",
